    <briefdescription>
<para>Integrates Raft consensus with WAL replication for automatic failover. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Provides:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Quorum-based writes (blocks until majority acknowledgment)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Automatic failover on leader failure</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Strong consistency (linearizable reads/writes)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Leadership management (starts/stops WAL Shipper) </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
